parameters.description:
The name of the new project file, with the extension .fto. A relative name is resolved
            against the working directory of the server (the /w startup option, else the folder the server was started from);
            an absolute path is used as given. The folder that is to contain the file must already exist.

sizeOfElements.description:
Expected mesh size (0 corresponds to the global mesh size);

Unit: m

Default value : 1.0

spacingFactor.description:
Secondary mesh size, used for non-uniform distribution;

Unit: m

Default value : 0.0

eccentricity.description:
eccentricity of element;

Unit: m

Default value : 0.0

thicknessIn1stVertex.description:
Thickness in 1st vertex;

Unit: m

Default value : 0.2

coefficientExpEuGen.description:
Exposure coefficient (Ce). GRCG_SNOWNF_NE_1991_1_3_COEXP_NORMAL_1 is an obsolete duplicate of GRCG_SNOWNF_NE_1991_1_3_NORMAL_TOPO_1;
GRCG_SNOWNF_EC1_COEXP_OTHER = user Ce, taken from GreenhouseParameters.ExpCoeffCe (EN 13031 greenhouse norms only;
under EN 1991-1-3 it gives Ce = 0; on Update send ExpCoeffCe in the same request)

Unit: -

Default: GRCG_SNOWNF_NE_1991_1_3_UNDER_WIND_08

thickness.description:
Thickness of load area taken into account for SelfWeight and RigidDiafragm;

Unit: m

Default value : 0.2

loadCaseActionType.description:
/// Load case action type (Base,leading(0)/Accompanying(1)/Base,leading or Accompanying(2)) or (Favorable(0)/Unfavorable(1)/Favorable or Unfavorable(2) ) 

Unit : - 

Default value : eADActionTypeBaseAndAcco (2)

liveLoadFactorF1Value.description:
READ ONLY: the f1 the model carries, which is what the generation applies - 1.0 for
public assembly, 0.5 otherwise. Writing AD.API.USCombinationsGenerationSettings.LiveLoadFactorF1 rewrites it;
a value sent here is ignored.
